<title>UK: Banco BBA-Creditanstalt sets 100 mln rand bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BBA-Creditanstalt sets 100 mln rand bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BBA-CREDITANSTALT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.625    MATURITY    19.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.00    PAY DATE    19.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/SA/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
